# SALES-002: NPS Analysis Report: Q4 2024

**Document ID:** SALES-002  
**Date:** January 17, 2025  
**Author:** Manus AI, Sales Operations  
**Distribution:** Executive Leadership, Sales, Product, and Customer Success Teams

## 1. Executive Summary

The Net Promoter Score (NPS) for MedSync Health in Q4 2024 reached an **Overall Company NPS of 71**, marking a strong close to the fiscal year. This score significantly exceeds the healthcare technology industry average of 45-55, demonstrating the high level of customer loyalty and satisfaction across our product portfolio. The analysis highlights the **MedSync Patient Portal (PROD-PORTAL)** as the top-performing product with an NPS of 75, driven by its intuitive user experience and direct patient impact. Conversely, **MedSync Analytics (PROD-ANALYTICS)**, while still achieving a strong score of 68, presents the primary opportunity for targeted improvement in the coming year.

